{"id":"n71306-2-7","stage":1,"title":"파랗다 · 发青","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71306-2-7-1","ko":"지수야, 너 입술이 왜 그렇게 파래?","zh":"智秀，你的嘴唇怎么这么发紫啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수야,","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；야：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"지수야","audio":"/audio/933aef68208bc459c4d9.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지수야","audio":"/audio/933aef68208bc459c4d9.mp3"}},{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}},{"text":"입술이","meaning":"嘴唇","explanation":"입술：嘴唇；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"입술","audio":"/audio/94eae6bfefacd134dec5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75753","senseId":"1","lemma":"입술","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"입술이","audio":"/audio/dd6fdc5f36b563d964fa.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么。","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"这么","explanation":"그렇게 在这里强调嘴唇发青的程度；中文说“怎么这么发紫”。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇게","audio":"/audio/b470a873a66143d27846.mp3"}},{"text":"파래?","meaning":"发青，发紫","explanation":"파랗다：发青，发紫；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"파랗다","audio":"/audio/27555478331997f6bc6b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71306","senseId":"2","lemma":"파랗다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"파래","audio":"/audio/35c1743dfa673aedb38c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"94eae6bfefacd134","term":"입술","zh":"嘴唇","audio":"/audio/94eae6bfefacd134dec5.mp3","entryId":"75753","definition":"围绕人的嘴周围的又红又软的肉。","pronunciation":["입쑬"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"27555478331997f6","term":"파랗다","zh":"发青，发紫","audio":"/audio/27555478331997f6bc6b.mp3","entryId":"71306","definition":"因为冷或害怕脸色或嘴唇等有点青。","pronunciation":["파ː라타"]}],"audio":"/audio/9aa67b8f2d7028a4c529.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71306-2-7-2","ko":"그래? 추워서 그런가 봐.","zh":"是吗？大概是太冷了吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래?","meaning":"是吗","explanation":"그래? 在听到对方提醒嘴唇发青时表示惊讶、确认，相当于“是吗？”。","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"2","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}},{"text":"추워서","meaning":"冷","explanation":"춥다：冷；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"춥다","audio":"/audio/7c651efb56d12a6540a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72146","senseId":"2","lemma":"춥다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"추워서","audio":"/audio/0b67ec971d5347edda2f.mp3"}},{"text":"그런가","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；ㄴ가：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그런가","audio":"/audio/1871cee48506a0d12f8c.mp3"}},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explana